# The recogniser in the deploy image (Dockerfile, stage `recogniser`; docs/RUNBOOK.md): the
# versions of the measured venv (docs/ALIGNMENT.md), on the Python 3.11 of Debian 12, which the
# image is built on. Locked with every wheel's hash into requirements.txt:
#   uv pip compile tools/align/requirements.in --python-version 3.11 --no-deps --generate-hashes \
#     --no-header -o tools/align/requirements.txt
# Installed with --no-deps: onnxruntime (and its flatbuffers and protobuf) serves only the voice
# filter, which transcribe.py leaves off, and hf-xet only downloads; neither is needed to run.
